sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Platform Management
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>CategoryDialog
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>UpdateCategoryBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>UpdateCategoryController
  participant Category as «entity»<br/>Category
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: edit a category
  UI->>B: PUT /api/management/categories/{id} (JWT)
  B->>C: update(Integer categoryId, CategoryRequest request)
  C->>Category: update()
  Category->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Category: rows
  Category-->>C: result
  C->>Category: save()
  Category->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Category: rows
  Category-->>C: result
  C-->>B: CategoryResponse
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result